        "created_at": "2012-06-15T03:27:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Now, I don’t know if anyone knows about TV Tropes, but here goes.</p>\n<p>Basically, it is a database/wiki/thing that is used to categorize things in the media – as well as certain “building blocks,” or tropes – by identifying characteristics that allow it to be compared and contrasted with other media.</p>\n<p>I’m creating a Sentinels TVTropes page, but I need help. If any of you feel like helping, take a little while to familiarize yourself with the site (<a href=\"http://tvtropes.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">tvtropes.org</a>) and then help me make the page better. <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SentinelsOfTheMultiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SentinelsOfTheMultiverse</a></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:48.512Z",
