        "id": 33613,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-15T06:39:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m an avid reader of TV Tropes, but I don’t know how good I am about identifying tropes.  I’ll try to recruit my Sentinels group to identify a few more.  At first glance, the only recommendation I have is to provide a more distinct explanation for the various Sentinels than “s/he is basically this other established character.”  That may not paint the game in a very positive light to outside viewers.  Plus, I would like to think that the characters are distinct enough to be described beyond famous heroes that have come before them.</p>\n<p>The point is, I’ll try to look it over when it isn’t almost two in the morning!</p>",
