        "created_at": "2012-06-15T15:02:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I remember being sad when I couldn’t find anything for the game on TVTropes (which is quite possibly my favorite site on the net due to its sheer amount of stuff to read). That said, I’m more of a lurker there since I’m not familiar with actually writing/editing pages there, and there tend to be a lot of easy ways to incorrectly cite a trope for a work. I’m on major crunch time at work right now, but if there’s still a need to expand the page in a week, I’ll give It a shot.</p>",
